  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1201.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2010-04-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1201.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in Env-Dw 1200 is to protect public health by establishing requirements applicable to privately owned redistribution systems (PORS) as defined in RSA 485:1-a, XIV-a.\n\nSource. #9572, INTERIM, eff 10-21-09, EXPIRES: 4-19-10; ss by #9660, eff 2-24-10; ss by #12582, eff 7-24-18",
